@@ -0,0 +1,139 @@
+;******************************************************************************
+;* optimized bswap buffer functions
+;* Copyright (c) 2008 Loren Merritt
+;* Copyright (c) 2003-2013 Michael Niedermayer
+;* Copyright (c) 2013 Daniel Kang
+;*
+;* This file is part of FFmpeg.
