+;*****************************************************************************
+;* SSE2-optimized weighted prediction code
+;*****************************************************************************
+;* Copyright (c) 2004-2005 Michael Niedermayer, Loren Merritt
+;* Copyright (C) 2010 Eli Friedman <eli.friedman@gmail.com>
