@@ -0,0 +1,104 @@
+/*
+ * SIMD-optimized HuffYUV encoding functions
+ * Copyright (c) 2000, 2001 Fabrice Bellard
+ * Copyright (c) 2002-2004 Michael Niedermayer <michaelni@gmx.at>
+ *
+ * MMX optimization by Nick Kurshev <nickols_k@mail.ru>
